  "name": "Lightning Ring",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Crackling electricity fills a 10-ft Emanation around you while you concentrate (up to 10 minutes). Whenever it reaches a creature, or a creature enters it or ends its turn there, you can force a CON save: 3d6 Lightning + 3d6 Thunder damage and Deafened for 1 minute on a failure, half damage only on a success (your allies are left alone). As a Magic action, emit a 60-ft-long, 5-ft-wide Line: DEX save, 6d6 Lightning damage, half on a success.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
